The fragment shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.shaders.matrix.mul.const_highp_mat4_float_fragment as dEQP-GLES2 writes it, rebuilt from modules/gles2/functional/es2fShaderMatrixTests.cpp (VK-GL-CTS 93bca01, NOTICE 5): deqp_shapes/misc_algebraic_rewrite.frag with mat4 for mat2; in0 is s_constInMat4[0] = tcu::translationMatrix(Vec3(0.2, -0.3, 0.15)) written by writeMatrixConstructor<4, 4> column by column with de::floatToString(x, 1) (0.15f prints 0.2), and the result is genGLSLMatToVec3Reduction's mat4 form.
